// The city's texts (city.js) in Maltese, as the sentences take them: server after "Is-server" as a genitive with
// ta'/tal- ("Is-server tal-belt ta' Brno mhux qed iwieġeb"), dataName as a subject before a colon ("…: m'hemmx tweġiba
// bħalissa"), dataShort as "mill-…/minn …" ("skont id-data mill-belt ta' Brno u minn OSM"), techMap as the subject before
// ": tagħbija…".
